{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"游走的收缩"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"游走的收缩"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"增广单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_+$ 上 $[0]$ 的左模范畴 $\\Delta_{\\bot}$, 即有最小值的全序集\n$$C_+([n]) = [n+1] = \\{\\bot,0,1,\\cdots,n\\}$$\n($n\\geq -1$) 和保持最小值的保序映射的范畴.</p>\n<p>定义<strong>游走的收缩</strong> (walking retract) $\\mathsf{Ret}$ 为 $\\Delta_\\bot$ 在两个对象</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$C_+([-1]) = [0] = \\{\\bot\\}$,</li>\n<li>$C_+([0]) = [1] =\\{\\bot,0\\}$</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上的全子范畴.</p>\n"}]}}